                                "sense_id": "b418f3d7-99bb-34cb-a527-b78a323246b8",
                                "text": "This, we believe was the first hospital to hotelize its rooms, and, quoting again from THE HOTEL MONTHLY (this from the issue of May 1924): \"One of the great movements of today is the hotelizing of hospitals.\""
